  "jcr:description": "Speed Spray62 pretreatment foam dispenser is made for point of use application, replacing the need for aerosol spray bottles. The Speed Spray62 dispenser delivers pretreatment quickly and effectively to provide better overall coverage, treating an entire tray of instruments in seconds. The Speed Spray62 dispenser can be mounted on a wall, or for more mobility, attached to an IV pole, and comes equipped with two wand application systems.\r\n",
