          "jcr:created": "Mon Apr 11 2022 18:05:14 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Versatile and more efficient&nbsp;<br>\n </span><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">pretreatment delivery</span></span></p>\n",
