    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-5891a4f69d@example.invalid",
    "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Faster and more efficient</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Faster and more efficient pretreatment delivery</li>\n<li>Total pretreatment coverage, helping to eliminate dried-on bioburden</li>\n<li>Two wand configurations to help spray into lumens or channels</li>\n<li>Versatile mounting options• Reduction in waste</li>\n</ul>\n",
